msgstr "主节点"

msgid "Active node"
msgstr "当前使用节点"

msgid "Manage a small AnyTLS node list. Use a node to copy it into the active sing-box config."
msgstr "管理轻量 AnyTLS 节点列表。使用节点会复制到当前 sing-box 配置。"

