msgid "Recommended: direct domains use domestic TCP DNS; domains matched by proxy rules use remote DoH through the selected node. Stargate only writes sing-box internal DNS and does not take over dnsmasq."
msgstr "推荐：直连域名使用国内 TCP DNS；命中代理规则的域名通过当前节点使用远端 DoH。Stargate 只写 sing-box 内部 DNS，不接管 dnsmasq。"

msgid "Recommended: direct domains use domestic TCP DNS; domains matched by proxy rules use remote DoH through the selected node."
msgstr "推荐：直连域名使用国内 TCP DNS；命中代理规则的域名通过当前节点使用远端 DoH。"

