msgstr "Quad9 DoH"

msgid "Used for domains matched by proxy rules. Presets avoid protocol and path mismatches that often make DNS fail silently."
msgstr "用于命中代理规则的域名。预设会避免协议和路径不匹配导致 DNS 静默失效。"

