msgstr "应用透明代理防火墙规则时，强制受管设备使用 Stargate DNS。"

msgid "DNS redirect port"
msgstr "DNS 重定向端口"

msgid "Use Loyalsoldier as the base rule source. Pick a blacklist or whitelist routing mode, then add only the few domains you want to override."
msgstr "以 Loyalsoldier 作为基础规则源。选择黑名单或白名单模式，只额外填写少量需要覆盖的域名。"

