msgstr "用户直连域名"

msgid "One domain per line. These domains always go direct and take priority over the base rules."
msgstr "每行一个域名。这些域名始终直连，并优先于基础规则。"

msgid "User proxy domains"
msgstr "用户代理域名"

msgid "One domain per line. These domains always use the node and take priority over the base rules."
msgstr "每行一个域名。这些域名始终走节点，并优先于基础规则。"

