msgstr "本机代理"

msgid "Enable Stargate with local SOCKS/HTTP inbounds only. Use Save & Apply in the bottom-right corner to commit this choice."
msgstr "启用 Stargate 本机 SOCKS/HTTP 入站。勾选后使用右下角“保存&应用”提交。"

msgid "Optional transparent inbound. It can only be selected after Local proxy is selected; Stargate still does not write firewall or DNS takeover rules by itself."
msgstr "可选透明入站。需要先勾选本机代理；Stargate 仍不会自动写入防火墙或 DNS 接管规则。"

msgid "Optional transparent inbound. Enable local proxy first, then configure forwarding on the Advanced page."
msgstr "可选透明入站。需要先勾选本机代理；之后到高级页配置转发。"

msgid "Forwarding and system integration settings for transparent proxy."
msgstr "透明代理的转发和系统集成设置。"

msgid "Forwarding"
msgstr "转发配置"

msgid "Forwarding rules"
msgstr "转发规则"

msgid "No firewall backend status."
msgstr "没有防火墙后端状态。"

msgid "Applies or removes only Stargate-owned transparent proxy forwarding rules. Backend is selected automatically: nftables first, iptables fallback."
msgstr "只应用或清理 Stargate 自己的透明代理转发规则。后端自动选择：优先 nftables，缺失时回退 iptables。"

msgid "Apply transparent forwarding"
msgstr "应用透明代理转发"

msgid "Clean Stargate forwarding"
msgstr "清理 Stargate 转发"

msgid "Enable local proxy first."
msgstr "请先勾选本机代理。"

